# The window's strategies and the scenes beyond the books, driven by scripted input (see docs/viewer.md, "Scripted
# input"), recorded and replayed. It quits by itself, so it runs without --exit-when-done:
#   RayTracingViewer cornell -w 320 --height 180 -s 32 --input tests\window-strategies.input --record r.txt --frames A
#   RayTracingViewer --headless --script r.txt --frames B
# Every frame in A equals the one in B of the same number (decoded), and each P's printed command, run, renders P's
# PNG and PFM. 32 samples at 320x180 take a few frames: every key below waits 20 frames for the image to be done.
#
# M through the Cornell box's cycle, from its own strategy (mixture): uniform, material (saved), lights, mixture, nee
# (saved), mis (saved), its own again, then uniform, named, which Tab takes along
at 20 key M
at 40 key M
at 60 key P
at 80 key M
at 100 key M
at 120 key M
at 140 key P
at 160 key M
at 180 key P
at 200 key M
at 220 key M
# Tab through the rest of the books' scenes under uniform, smoke, final, aluminum and glass, to the first beyond them,
# cornell-ggx, which can't take it: its own (mis) instead, with a note
at 240 key Tab
at 260 key Tab
at 280 key Tab
at 300 key Tab
at 320 key Tab
# M from its own: the books' uniform skipped for material
at 340 key M
# veach and studio under material; on studio, T from its own display (agx) to neutral, and F2 refused: the quality
# kernel computes in float32 only
at 360 key Tab
at 380 key Tab
at 400 key T
at 420 key F2
# T to the books' bytes; Tab to sunlit, then around to the first of the books' scenes; F2 to float64 there
at 440 key T
at 460 key Tab
at 480 key Tab
at 500 key F2
# A notch of the wheel and Shift+M in one batch: the move still waiting is shown first, under uniform. Shift+M twice
# more: the scene's own (material), then past mis, nee, mixture and lights, which a scene without lamps would render
# as material, to material, named
at 520 wheel 1
at 520 key-down Left Shift
at 520 key M
at 540 key M
at 560 key M
at 560 key-up Left Shift
# Shift+Tab in float64: the four scenes beyond the books skipped (float32 only), to glass under material
at 580 key-down Left Shift
at 580 key Tab
at 580 key-up Left Shift
# M: lights, mixture, then past nee and mis (float32 only) to the scene's own; F2 back to float32
at 600 key M
at 620 key M
at 640 key M
at 660 key F2
at 680 quit
